# lock6.input with PLAYER 1<->5 and 2<->6: run with
#   NHL94_SEATS=home:LW,away:RW,home:RD,away:G,home:C,away:C
# the same roles get the same inputs as lock6.input, but the C seats are
# now virtual pads and LW/RW real pads 1/2 (equivalence check).
# Player lock test, 6 seats (seats 5-6 are virtual pads):
#   NHL94_SEATS=home:C,away:C,home:RD,away:G,home:LW,away:RW
# (menu: Head to Head, 30-second periods). PLAYER n = seat n-1.
# Seat 2 (home:RD) is the game's pad 3 and seat 4 (home:LW) its virtual pad
# goes through pad 3's slots; seat 3 (away:G) is pad 4 and seat 5 (away:RW)
# goes through pad 4's. Phases per period: all six at once in different
# directions (s0 UP, s1 UP, s2 RIGHT, s3 LEFT, s4 DOWN, s5 DOWN), then seat
# 4 alone RIGHT, then seat 5 alone LEFT. Period 1: home attacks up; period 2:
# home attacks down (remap flips the other team).
WAIT 600
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS DOWN 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
WRITE_RAM16 0xFFD050 0x0003
PRESS START 5
WAIT 420
PLAYER 5
HOLD UP
PLAYER 6
HOLD UP
PLAYER 3
HOLD RIGHT
PLAYER 4
HOLD LEFT
PLAYER 1
HOLD DOWN
PLAYER 2
HOLD DOWN
WAIT 120
RELEASE
PLAYER 1
RELEASE
PLAYER 4
RELEASE
PLAYER 3
RELEASE
PLAYER 6
RELEASE
PLAYER 5
RELEASE
WAIT 30
PLAYER 1
HOLD RIGHT
WAIT 60
RELEASE
WAIT 30
PLAYER 2
HOLD LEFT
WAIT 60
RELEASE
WAIT_RAM16 0xFFC468 0x0000
WAIT 330
PLAYER 1
PRESS START 5
WAIT_RAM16 0xFFC2EA 0x0200
WAIT 30
PLAYER 5
HOLD UP
PLAYER 6
HOLD UP
PLAYER 3
HOLD RIGHT
PLAYER 4
HOLD LEFT
PLAYER 1
HOLD DOWN
PLAYER 2
HOLD DOWN
WAIT 120
RELEASE
PLAYER 1
RELEASE
PLAYER 4
RELEASE
PLAYER 3
RELEASE
PLAYER 6
RELEASE
PLAYER 5
RELEASE
WAIT 30
PLAYER 1
HOLD RIGHT
WAIT 60
RELEASE
WAIT 30
PLAYER 2
HOLD LEFT
WAIT 60
RELEASE
WAIT 300
